msgstr "Réservation de ressource"

#. module: bf_outreach_appointment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_outreach_appointment.field_bf_outreach_target__booking_url
msgid ""
"To drop into the outreach email: the target picks their own slot, and the "
"booking moves their file along by itself."
msgstr ""
"À insérer dans le courriel de démarchage : la cible choisit elle-même sa "
"plage, et le rendez-vous pris fait avancer son dossier."

#. module: bf_outreach_appointment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_outreach_appointment.field_bf_outreach_campaign__booking_type_id
msgid ""
"Type offered to this campaign's targets. Its public link is available on "
"every target, ready to drop into the email template."
msgstr ""
"Type proposé aux cibles de cette campagne. Son lien public est disponible "
"sur chaque cible, pour le glisser dans le modèle de courriel."
